      "degree_level": "Bachelor, Master",
      "process_description": "To do a BSc or MSc thesis at IfI you should first check the Bachelor's/Master's Thesis fact sheets and the \"Preparation of BSc/MSc Theses\" fact sheet on the IfI website (these and the Faculty study regulations are the official guidelines). Use the Specializations and Topics per Professor table to identify likely supervisors and contact the research groups or professors directly to discuss topics. Follow module order (e.g. compulsory program → Informatics Internship → Bachelor’s Thesis) and the plagiarism / scientific integrity rules. Register using the Bachelor's thesis registration form and submit registrations and final theses electronically from your UZH e‑mail to studies@ifi.uzh.ch. Inform yourself about all deadlines on the Faculty/IfI pages. Contact: Daniela Bärtschi, Study Coordination.",
